pipe AliceがWETHをCarolへ送る
layout mesh

box alice as Alice
box usdc as USDC
box weth as WETH
box dai as DAI
box bob as Bob
box carol as Carol

hold alice: 1000 USDC, 5 WETH, 300 DAI
hold bob: 2 WETH
hold carol: 1 WETH

step 1 WETHがAliceからCarolへ移る
  say AliceがWETH.transferを呼び出します。1 WETHがAliceからCarolへ移動します。
  alice -> weth: transfer(to: carol, amount: 1 WETH)
  move weth: 1 alice -> carol
  emit weth: Transfer(from: alice, to: carol, amount: 1 WETH)
  return weth
